  "sbBodyWhatIs": "Shadbala ('chhah guna bal') mapta hai ki har grah mein apne parinam dene ki kitni shakti hai, chhah swatantra bal sroton ko jodkar.",
  "sbBodyRupas": "Bal Rupa mein mapa jata hai (1 Rupa = 60 Virupa). Majboot mane jaane ke liye har grah ko nyuntam Rupa bal chahiye; adhik Rupa ka matlab hai ki wah apne parinam adhik purnata se deta hai.",
  "sbBodyHowCalc": "Chhah bal jode jaate hain: Sthana (sthiti se sambandhit), Dig (disha se sambandhit), Kala (samay se sambandhit), Chesta (gati se sambandhit), Naisargika (prakritik) aur Drik (drishti se sambandhit). Kul ki tulna grah ki avashyak nyuntam seema se karke pratishat prapt kiya jata hai.",
  "sbBodyHowUse": "100% se upar wala grah apne karakatva sahajta se deta hai; 100% se neeche hone par sahayata ki zaroorat hoti hai. Mahatvapurn maamlon ke liye apne sabse majboot grahon ko prathamikta dein, aur sabse kamzor grahon ko upay aur dhairya dein.",
  "sbRemedyStrong": "Achhi tarah se samarthit — kisi khaas upay ki zaroorat nahi; aap is grah ki avadhiyon ka aatmavishwas se upyog kar sakte hain.",
  "sbHeroSummary": "{strongP} aapka sabse majboot grah hai, jo {strongTrait} ke liye utkrisht sahyog deta hai. {weakP} sabse kamzor hai aur upayon se sabse zyada labhaanvit hota hai.",
